{"unit_id":"HiAi-gg__dsh-docsmint#feature-1","repo":"HiAi-gg/dsh-docsmint","commit":"8d5afe0567a8a23ec0a557b3e1df02d11c925256","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DocsMint 的功能「搜索并读取知识文档」：agent 可按自然语言或关键词搜索工作区，查看命中的标题、摘要和分数，再读取指定文档的 Markdown 正文及链接。搜索和读取可通过已连接的 API 或 MCP transport 调用。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:1278-1306","index.js:1346-1388"]}
